id: SCA-020
title: GitHub Actions environment variable injection
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: GITHUB_
patterns:
  - regex: >>\s*\$GITHUB_(ENV|OUTPUT|PATH)
    message: Writing to GITHUB_ENV/OUTPUT/PATH can allow environment variable injection if untrusted input is included. Multi-line injection via delimiter manipulation is possible.
fix: Sanitize all input before writing to GITHUB_ENV. Use a fixed delimiter. Never write raw untrusted content to environment files.
